steps.prompt:
Feature request: {{task}}

Repo: {{workdir}}. Based on the requirements at {{artifacts.requirements}}, author the TECHNICAL DESIGN. First explore the codebase at {{workdir}} (relevant sources, build configs, similar features) so the design fits existing patterns. Write the design to {{setup.output}}/02-design.md.

If a review exists at {{setup.output}}/design-review.json, this is a revision — the run directory is fresh for this run, so a review file present there always means a genuine loop-back within THIS run, never a stale file from an earlier one. Read it and the full review at {{setup.output}}/03-design-review.md, and for each finding either address it, backlog it (with a reason), or justify ignoring it — aligned with the original requirements. Note your responses to the findings at the end of the document.
